      "extract": "[]{#sec:intro label=\"sec:intro\"} In this paper, I will describe an extension of the *groupoidification* program of Baez and Dolan [@hdaVII]. Groupoidification refers to the program of treating parts of linear algebra as arising from spans of groupoids (categories whose morphisms are all invertible) by a process of \"degroupoidification\", which produces complex vector spaces associated to groupoids, and linear maps",
